    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tx8d](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tx8d) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 10 2026 78km E of Tepa. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.8742 longitude 130.2935. It impacted 1940 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
